#: e428a67a00084196988a15010e8a8c9a faad8ab035c14eed9e9fe28b9740db2d
msgid ""
"at this time only a few autopilots have this capability. See instructions "
"below to determine if an autopilot has this feature. Only H7 based "
"autopilots using MMC connected SD cards are capable of this and not all that"
" do have had the feature added as of yet."
msgstr ""
"目前仅少数飞控具备此功能。请参阅以下说明确认飞控是否支持。只有使用 MMC 连接 SD 卡的 H7 "
"飞控才具备此能力，且并非所有支持的飞控都已添加此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:14
