msgstr "飞行器的 USB 接口不方便或无法可靠访问"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:18
#: 109cc2ea151b4ed89d5ea7ca0283b938 2e5b99098c574ada80553c425f77360f
#: 3bd5d83c43a541b08f2c0213a57b1d38 a61b54be867f45e9a053449994259030
#: b18d2b50d35248cdab4549e0f04bd347 bcd2b4f721454fcaaccb142fd9983b9d
#: d6754878ddae469997e161af729fdd8a f4f95d415a8642aca37ecbc02bfdd69a
msgid "It is desired to update the vehicle firmware over a telemetry radio"
msgstr "希望通过数传电台更新飞行器固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:19
#: 171a093fd1394ce78d639430fbedf94e 4402a96dbe3645a1b93ca0fc91658207
#: 5af21554535749839e6f239fabd8e40a 8db118f0a85149efbf7e0715179ca3a5
#: 924b5c549ea0456f80aeef108e925c09 bac9da61214c44b989546d788367dc7e
#: d6efa074a0374deab99c380f263caf80 f4797f7a18b54b5b9ea6a805263e3019
msgid ""
"The vehicle is remote and the local operators may struggle with the normal "
"interfaces to update the firmware. This allows OEMs to remotely add an "
"updated file onto users' SD cards which would upload on the next boot of the"
" vehicle."
msgstr ""
"飞行器位于偏远地区，现场操作人员可能无法通过常规接口更新固件。这允许 OEM 厂商远程将更新文件放入用户的 SD 卡，在飞行器下次启动时自动烧写。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:22
#: 05ecff5e48fb421d9c4bdb71e04cedef 2c60b508c4c34556a955acda0150dc29
#: 57c1ae849ab845d5823a49043c176c76 60a43f77d94d45d98c1e3a373e078e8d
#: 614684faa6574898a510b3d5945f88b8 879daa3c3a734de591f23e52680ab4ff
#: db84bf8960da457085b448f8d159c915 e349c43db0c54a9886b3e3415154bf92
msgid "Is my autopilot capable of this?"
msgstr "我的飞控是否支持此功能？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:23
#: 3e98267500be4e5f8f700d0fb619bfb3 4281353ab81b4429946f2a89a909e89c
#: 4fef612aea5143d0835448e18b9a7c2a 6a5a529bd0db4f04969799dce9ea33bf
#: 6fa20d68a2bd4961b333fec592aff1f5 71f76aa4f147438ead074b4e8fce4209
#: 8cc462d6d81047ce9e9b4120c682d734 ba1b8dccd43e477e939ac765e2de797c
msgid "In order to do this several elements must be present:"
msgstr "要支持此功能，需要具备以下几个条件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:25
#: 595c360715584affa140595ad72cb655 6443efe76d404f0b8a527c2b3538262b
#: 700f2e6b4e4f4e8ebd551933e25b30c7 8d6b0268f4a14a989787601e33db08e2
#: c2c111c2790445879cc31a1bfa2ccb07 e0fd736e785447429d86c8f409a9343b
#: e2de09d1df024d1b8b9e82b811ec2006 f4907c57b9404bb185062102eaa85b02
msgid "The autopilot must have SD card capability"
msgstr "飞控必须具备 SD 卡功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:26
#: 127e5837384f4393ab6e2f68b09c51de 21540058aac24e44a1ba5f40ef667739
#: 49581a3f536740eeb8796f17ad5a65b5 7dc0a4726e4d4f949c84bcd214f9a20d
#: 8a7b46a3fd6c4b34b68534d3c3c595ad ba2a12bb4d4b4832871743f85cb3dd8e
#: ce33af90de4549d89ed385f93ad78394 d8792fbaa4bb488f8bca213b1e5a04af
msgid "The SD card must be enabled in its bootloader"
msgstr "SD 卡必须在引导程序中启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:27
#: 218c44a362e54282a2a6d769a5d98af0 234844c0d9f646d7aaf13b1d96d47d58
#: 2f4dd5d8a83147caa611b5c938eb3d47 8f38012055554af98e42f8b683a646de
#: 98b291ab9f0349b49d25d46debde1e64 e1db438b3b1c4a31bab55ed7ec938bba
#: e59e6493e2df481b9abb02afd1cfff93 f0029624fad749698e8ed91816ecd920
msgid ""
"The bootloader code and flashing firmware must be enabled in the autopilots "
"firmware definition files (hwdefs)"
msgstr "引导程序代码和烧写固件功能必须在飞控固件定义文件（hwdefs）中启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:29
#: 01aa8ebf3d0542b19db4dc1131e11a6f 28cc6e364dd7481095408d051d0bf23d
#: 33d6c335931f406ba253f778c9297c24 347f42cfdec24524aab83cda6900e845
#: 3ff6c01385074499b3e6c478eb2b2b6f 6c49ba5976884acf85b846e84bf40e46
#: 9d56a52546314b07a15ed9cf84935caf f0a08d17c22f4cd7856e51f286d6f39c
msgid ""
"To see if a given autopilot has this capability, you can check in its "
"firmware folder on the `Firmware build server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ to see if it has a ``xxxxxx.abin`` file "
"present."
msgstr ""
"要检查特定飞控是否具备此功能，可在 `固件构建服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上的飞控固件目录中查找是否存在 ``xxxxxx.abin`` 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:32
#: 0c97f4d73f514bd3bd6d16276b3505b8 2c2224f8a35a47648532cd5313870d56
#: 30715d40b49340358067529839dd080f 46e1030aa8854ab9b5b5cd28c7691613
#: 5eb4b79702414c809017fc233f3ad943 771cd0ed45b4409c94d5bf77193f7c12
#: 7f9049ee9a7a4984b89539dd5baae6e3 be044ced1dde4ed388a1771758e1e121
msgid "The Bootloader"
msgstr "引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:33
#: 1e044f025f83423ba983ea90c77f5370 283860ae641544f4b8e5ab811c266c62
#: 45b6c3d5bc7f44d7bfdb0a314a491ee8 68db8a52a6124c7e9ab31f9391f23bb5
#: 6d841e32152042b6a3f458d2e13d7aaa aac7bdf907cf4dae9b94ba59012dc05f
#: bc93e56f8f6a42428956c2930e3e922b eedf96afa75744118cbc70952eb2e9b2
msgid ""
"A bootloader capable of flashing from the SD card is required (and the "
"autopilot must have SD card capability, obviously). Newer autopilot's with "
"SD cards may or may not have this capability and a capable bootloader "
"included in their hardware definition (if not, see :ref:`Building capable "
"firmware yourself <building-autoflash-firmware>`)."
msgstr ""
"需要支持从 SD 卡烧写的引导程序（且飞控必须具备 SD 卡功能）。较新的带 SD 卡的飞控可能包含也可能不包含此功能和对应的引导程序（如未包含，请参阅"
" :ref:`自行编译支持的固件 <building-autoflash-firmware>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:35
#: 1f178fba438243e4bc765f16444c2ce2 307d869653804f3cb15b4058b72d9cde
#: 4f5240d86ce74ac69cc89cf7184ed5a2 5a18586bc8084b7ea8cde99290cdedab
#: 6266f2368a2b4e958e404420614eedd0 6c92552e034149f9b89fa78ad3c8da59
#: 8fe48048ed514d4385f50627568200e9 e0244ff219384b99ba92a2595888f009
msgid ""
"If the autopilot firmware currently provides this capability, updating your "
"current bootloader may be required to support flashing from SD card.  Note "
"that updating the autopilot's bootloader is an operation which can make your"
" board non-operational, and difficult to recover.  More-so with boards that "
"do not expose a \"boot0\" pin, such as the CubeOrange.  Be aware of this "
"risk, and be prepared to spend considerable time recovering a board if "
"something bad happens when updating the bootloader."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控固件目前提供此功能，可能需要更新引导程序才能支持从 SD "
"卡烧写。请注意，更新飞控引导程序是一项可能导致主板无法工作的操作，且难以恢复。对于未暴露「boot0」引脚的主板（如 "
"CubeOrange）尤为如此。请充分了解此风险，并做好在引导程序更新出错时花费大量时间恢复主板的准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:37
#: 2a952bb1ee804a048385b16b5b5b76dc 402dc207c1dc4658ba00ac76ccf2165e
#: a8677c4dd3dd4bcc89046bcc4a615993 a9b27cc7baa04bc5ba975235411b8156
#: bbc7e670a7654bc7a89a16d974737a14 d98101914c0549d68cf5af3b3c4f833b
#: ee61cc0e1df4453c8621f27a827b1e71 f2d1ca1e30e14157987c254080c8f2eb
msgid ""
":ref:`The instructions on updating the bootloader <common-bootloader-"
"update>` can be followed to update your bootloader; be aware that you must "
"use a recent firmware (4.5 or higher) to obtain a suitable bootloader."
msgstr ""
":ref:`更新引导程序的说明 <common-bootloader-update>` 可供参考；请注意必须使用较新的固件（4.5 "
"或更高版本）才能获取合适的引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:40
#: 05f35f105beb45158a261e969c39f34e 08ce452d35f840279011b38132016870
#: 10f9d39844b04dc99e6829d52c8eb37b 59f08d8579ad426d99325952b620e5ba
#: 9fe890d83edc4549881d746a20a33394 a145804582b2449cac8b8c32a18d347c
#: e7954776e0d94e08b7e8ae893b9f64ff fc3a4e66b2b44892ab6fdda9f6f6bf1a
msgid "The Firmware File"
msgstr "固件文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:41
#: 0d6f11d84f034f60a1b75cd2d870f633 0e75a5cb746b43a090092cff6f9a4158
#: 34ce7f6334e447679d67d56c2a77c818 4801a199949349288a69ca9e813a0c17
#: 4d585f3656694deaba24473902904749 544d2302397949dfab67bca250afbb9a
#: bfce1a5f8f654228b05e8eaa783f7f77 fe3035c417e043f2a75bdb260cdae489
msgid ""
"The file to be loaded onto the SD card is of a specially named "
"\"xxxxx.abin\" file created for this purpose.  This is a binary file with a "
"small amount of text providing some information about the binary. Most "
"notably, a checksum which the bootloader will verify before attempting to "
"flash the board."
msgstr ""
"需要放到 SD "
"卡上的文件是专门为此目的创建的特定名称「xxxxx.abin」文件，这是一个包含少量文本信息的二进制文件，其中包含校验和，引导程序在尝试烧写主板前会进行验证。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:43
#: 119d4c79a5614557aa83175a3a89c948 4abc50989a074f879783e6f360ffa0f6
#: 830a0d40573d4eacab1936c8fbda203e 98edb83a16344c71863da048dfca3d26
#: b486643db3db4ea5a4f1b0fbbe49a3a7 bba73e35a6374fb0b39fc09aed3e5cf7
#: e777831e138c4d548697c60207df9f8b fa43fa34a7d64047a9ad753cc80c5362
msgid ""
"Boards which support flash-from-sdcard will also have ``.abin`` files "
"available for download from the `Firmware build server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"支持从 SD 卡烧写的主板，在 `固件构建服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 上也提供 ``.abin`` "
"文件下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:46
#: 059e5a5b06ba44769e4e5ca965d03f3c 2cbb842a683a47bfa4d87f5352422ae9
#: 3c6d84ba94c34f6bbef26f8c608bb43c 750f360af2ce4856979e41f2486494c8
#: 840bcb3fb5294e33834dd1c63da42294 9c9982f9a4d14e278e09110b10c7ffdc
#: b85e337b74e44ebda2d1bbb45f0589f7 f76237b168a74759894c4bc2a7c92f1c
msgid "Firmware File Name"
msgstr "固件文件名"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:47
#: 2f3d2cc35c344fcab63fb8e3ef060b60 4aaaae3270fa4bd19a42023c544f457d
#: 54e5b94249ee41bebe50f8e380096555 65ba99788037465da27b9541ec3feff4
#: 7939fad5c5be4feaa1619056de506ffe 7ba8a951b13d4be5a55c045ed161de32
#: b757ff65203f410a941eeb88b04a9a7f d44948280ac24a38b881ba56bb23771d
msgid ""
"The filename which is used when generating firmware is ***not*** the correct"
" name to use when placing the firmware on the SD card.  When the ``.abin`` "
"files are generated they contain the vehicle name, for example, "
"\"arduplane.abin\"."
msgstr ""
"生成固件时使用的文件名* **不是** *放置到 SD 卡时应使用的正确名称。生成的 ``.abin`` "
"文件包含飞行器名称，例如「arduplane.abin」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:49
#: 28d6430400794852a79239855859ad63 2e69123e25f64ecbbcd5b665a8ce8bd0
#: 8436fef74aac42c0aa6db5719f1410cb 91ad6378a20545bca8d29c9261722720
#: b298d701175842b8b95039ac98e810c3 b4762f77bda94f16ace19d81b50dfc44
#: ebe7d0bbf64d4746af99d4bf3e9f8f6f f9996c5f59f945139024f40a232ff3b2
msgid ""
"There is only one correct filename that may be used to flash-from-sdcard; "
"this is ``ardupilot.abin``.  When placing the file on the SD card, ensure "
"the file has been renamed to ``ardupilot.abin``."
msgstr ""
"从 SD 卡烧写只有一个正确的文件名，即 ``ardupilot.abin``。将文件放置到 SD 卡时，确保将文件重命名为 "
"``ardupilot.abin``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:52
#: 1124d88c2a634335a6550404753036a2 1efce4ef7acd4e0a87c12d1313fba690
#: 30a0da98de5f44148e8c68901c137d2d 4e2dffc4453d410fad125514ea46deaf
#: 587c6ff39f3e47deb5fcdd0264b14fa6 c3fecabfc68a4c15a6049d81e5afaffe
#: e171f7820cdb48b4bb308358f113a255 e37c9351016c4c5aaa4d6d4eb219d220
msgid "Transferring the File to the SD card"
msgstr "将文件传输到 SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:53
#: 0004b42be9f64c4cb3f556ffa95d549f 11bbb684c603457592a656a2093fba79
#: 1cc89362eb65402cad6fbd9e88b82a53 328d9c50efed42f9bbbfbe6a38331f78
#: 82543e08888544938d69a63cff8103f9 9d74c88147e94bfaa6f992bf69754b70
#: c6b677dc2dc642ab856cd411fb4b30a7 cf353875fd7943c9beadc7524caefc09
msgid ""
"This can be done in your operating system as you would ordinarily interact "
"with the SD card (e.g. file browser)."
msgstr "可以在操作系统中像平时操作 SD 卡一样完成（例如通过文件浏览器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:55
#: 0213063c2d7b498aa9579305697fad19 1a38171b9d704e7dba0a30b68478e6b2
#: 25b4c58b589d44a9a822221fe385a047 56a2a46625534237aefda68e1734e579
#: 6a68776b6bd94fc889f110e8fff7bf5f 6bc019b118a148e1a372cbfd01ff4ad4
#: 7f88ae6c020249c581d39ca43772f625 81d1d4069f164ea49ffe96e61c3e6539
msgid ""
"You can also transfer the file to the SD card's base directory via "
"``MAVFTP`` using Mission Planner or similar GCS"
msgstr "也可以通过Mission Planner或类似地面站，使用 ``MAVFTP`` 将文件传输到 SD 卡根目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:60
#: 02f17f1a4725437bbdd954eb810b739b 1fcab4b4b3384f118969b7393acc7b1d
#: 301686be3e3a4b2e8aba00455cae9793 65d9e4e0b2d64931949c54c86f6614e0
#: 98f02cb2c23e40159b85978cc86600d2 a4117507be7b411f9dd0722a2ea9ad39
#: edef384151984881b960771992689385 fa7e08ff55914cce86342ba0523007a2
msgid "Ensure the file is the correct size before continuing."
msgstr "继续前请确认文件大小正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:62
#: 31272ffa3a404f64871446b3f9701991 42951700b24741be8e52acb8f715fef1
