#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:85
#: 078acb4d20764e6c8a7ca89b4cbded13 10a7e3cf2caa45e7b458018c4e88d2a5
#: 1323143d61684dddbff73d63d56c11cb 238f6fe465a2464e867812c65b2d2052
#: 88e08518b03a44ac948df804df38b7df a8343bc553b04567a0b66113c26b4020
#: b5df5c28cd09432699644f4ec9d7c295 cf4f193d39b344f59b3bc82e674a0914
msgid ""
"Several things can go wrong with the firmware flash, but some diagnostics "
"are available to help work out what the problem might be."
msgstr "固件烧写过程中可能出现多种问题，以下诊断信息可帮助判断问题原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:87
#: 45552aa4ee5d455b85539ba01151010a 56c4c79597f84d5598bc042266ab5e60
#: 6c9cc50d8af14eb7893756717989ca01 703e945c1097489d9710bdd4c94e0be4
#: a35c615ca9ff4b5d9ca266da54a3f563 d04c186de83c484eb142c78d3a56eb4a
#: ec6f43c7cece4ae99871e021e0277a65 f2c1b78f51d34e61998cee7c855efb0f
msgid ""
"At each stage of the flashing process, the ``ardupilot.abin`` file is "
"renamed to reflect the stage"
msgstr "在烧写流程的每个阶段，``ardupilot.abin`` 文件会被重命名以反映当前阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:88
#: 01ec308efce54f4880c0692a291c7ba3 25fb884c33c84d62a34114b9ccb85157
#: 45898a5cb36e4b92beeaeb4091fd1176 6a7f3f33175446a5acf06fd17e4c847b
#: 87c4f9679872423381c47c2870a97a1a 920e189805b541ecb887e0838dd7d09c
#: 9970972ae9524b48a64e34795f51ccc5 d990d3789a284f51aadbf06b5ff8c97f
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-verify.abin`` then the process failed when"
" trying to checksum the file, or the board was interrupted when doing so."
msgstr "若文件名为 ``ardupilot-verify.abin``，则流程在校验文件校验和时失败，或在校验过程中被中断"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:89
#: 2fedf324c7ae4d5491ddea8e95867c02 87f55355c7cb45f39c60da09bdb9d96d
#: 8dbfbcffab7346f288802f4b476964a0 96fd9defe348437bba949ca6da467a52
#: a2200bedc4054adfb933ac3466b5ceed c023b14d0a4f4504878901b7bd3c254e
#: cbaafcb42e86457eb2c11db7820c488f e232b0467b7644ac94677d4de4c439d4
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-verify-failed.abin`` then the checksum the"
" bootloader calculated did not match the bootloader in the ``.abin`` "
"metadata."
msgstr ""
"若文件名为 ``ardupilot-verify-failed.abin``，则引导程序计算的校验和与 ``.abin`` 元数据中的校验和不匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:90
#: 1c447256de9e48308760d7bd1d968a15 3797ad52875d4e9cab74dd748e96a24e
#: 4bd47418a94a45adb8c4e94abc4ebe4b 8283067d030e464db41b327846de4008
#: 97e363d4ff1d4c97894877ca767436c2 d40daac20e6244f481cd236e8d3408ae
#: de5760a5a3e14132bc3c23052c24b76b fe87c95abb1e4b90993633be2edad1d2
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-flash.abin`` the process failed when "
"writing the firmware, or the board was interrupted while doing so.  The "
"board is unlikely to boot into an ArduPilot firmware if this has happened, "
"so a re-flash will be required."
msgstr ""
"若文件名为 ``ardupilot-flash.abin``，则固件写入过程失败，或在写入时被中断。若发生这种情况，主板很可能无法启动 "
"ArduPilot 固件，需要重新烧写。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:91
#: 0bb75606d6d243cf8f5477c47d7f623f 2df9730dac9d406ea3cebe9ac0d2c8ef
#: 2fe444ea3fba4f26aa659e9def15cc02 44547676e937418e97965b213a90ff48
#: 722f4b32d1984a81a890a0ae51a7ec1c 7fa5cce07af34ad6993d515bfc14d0d2
#: 8610a1454a5b4accb42b930435b6749a b496297e610146a597392f48a4ab1964
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-flashed.abin`` you should not need this "
"\"troubleshooting\" section, as the flash process has succeeded!"
msgstr "若文件名为 ``ardupilot-flashed.abin``，则无需查看本「故障排除」章节，烧写流程已成功完成！"

